{"id":"n63796-1-5","stage":5,"title":"손색 · 逊色","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63796-1-5-1","ko":"이번 학기에 지수가 반장으로 뽑혔어.","zh":"这学期智秀被选为班长啦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"학기에","meaning":"学期","explanation":"학기：学期；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"학기","audio":"/audio/a95c145d8eb8427ea655.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72420","senseId":"1","lemma":"학기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지수가","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"반장으로","meaning":"班长","explanation":"반장：班长；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"반장","audio":"/audio/42215d859bc4bc8e6a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57186","senseId":"3","lemma":"반장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뽑혔어.","meaning":"被选出","explanation":"뽑히다：被选出；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"뽑히다","audio":"/audio/e38b8bcd2bc666678047.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15652","senseId":"3","lemma":"뽑히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"a95c145d8eb8427e","term":"학기","zh":"学期","audio":"/audio/a95c145d8eb8427ea655.mp3","entryId":"72420","definition":"按照学业要求将一个学年划分成的时间段。","pronunciation":["학끼"]},{"id":"42215d859bc4bc8e","term":"반장","zh":"班长","audio":"/audio/42215d859bc4bc8e6a78.mp3","entryId":"57186","definition":"学校里代表班级的人。","pronunciation":["반장"]},{"id":"e38b8bcd2bc66667","term":"뽑히다","zh":"被选出","audio":"/audio/e38b8bcd2bc666678047.mp3","entryId":"15652","definition":"从多个中被挑选出来。","pronunciation":["뽀피다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7cb005794a3db475293c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n63796-1-5-2","ko":"다른 사람을 잘 챙기고 꼼꼼하니까 반장으로는 손색이 없겠네.","zh":"她很会照顾别人，做事也细心，当班长再合适不过了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람을","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，熟练地","explanation":"잘：很好地，熟练地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"챙기고","meaning":"照顾","explanation":"챙기다：照顾；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"챙기다","audio":"/audio/39b299d8d470abe5d844.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29778","senseId":"4","lemma":"챙기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"꼼꼼하니까","meaning":"细密，细致","explanation":"꼼꼼하다：细密，细致；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"꼼꼼하다","audio":"/audio/0e7cec40f3517746ddf7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37863","senseId":"1","lemma":"꼼꼼하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"반장으로는","meaning":"班长","explanation":"반장：班长；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"반장","audio":"/audio/42215d859bc4bc8e6a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57186","senseId":"3","lemma":"반장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"손색이","meaning":"逊色","explanation":"손색：逊色；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"손색","audio":"/audio/21bfcd0fa55a33b411d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63796","senseId":"1","lemma":"손색","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없겠네.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f1f4ce417552e197","term":"다른","zh":"其他，别的","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3","entryId":"64530","definition":"除相关之外的。","pronunciation":["다른"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，熟练地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"熟悉而擅长地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"39b299d8d470abe5","term":"챙기다","zh":"照顾","audio":"/audio/39b299d8d470abe5d844.mp3","entryId":"29778","definition":"关怀或照料某人。","pronunciation":["챙기다"]},{"id":"0e7cec40f3517746","term":"꼼꼼하다","zh":"细密，细致","audio":"/audio/0e7cec40f3517746ddf7.mp3","entryId":"37863","definition":"很细心，很沉着，毫无漏洞。","pronunciation":["꼼꼼하다"]},{"id":"42215d859bc4bc8e","term":"반장","zh":"班长","audio":"/audio/42215d859bc4bc8e6a78.mp3","entryId":"57186","definition":"学校里代表班级的人。","pronunciation":["반장"]},{"id":"21bfcd0fa55a33b4","term":"손색","zh":"逊色","audio":"/audio/21bfcd0fa55a33b411d9.mp3","entryId":"63796","definition":"和别人或别的东西比较时的不足之处。","pronunciation":["손ː색"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不具有某物，或不具备资格、能力。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/1c83277a9fb2ed6b25f0.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.544,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=63796","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":172,"sequenceScore":3.3707,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["她很会照顾别人，做事也细心，当班长再合适不过了。","我还是决定不了，是要选这个还是那个呢。","这学期智秀被选为班长啦。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["她很会照顾别人，